  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1189887.svg\" alt=\"标题\" width=\"386\" height=\"24\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/linear pipes/screen.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;一个资源包，全面改造<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pipez</a>模组中所有管道方块的模型与纹理，使其视觉效果更美观，并与<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a>模组风格完美契合！</span></span></p><p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/image.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"演示\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"演示\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">同时完整收录<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">精美管道：Mekanism版</a>的所有物品资源</span></p><p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/item.png?raw=true\" alt=\"物品展示\" width=\"915\" height=\"454\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本项目融合了<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">精美管道：Mekanism版</a>的模型纹理与<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smart-pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">智能管道</a>的方块模型逻辑<br></span></p>",
